		{"height":387,"id":"f21ebc3791d4a7ed","text":"---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n#### Description\nStickers are image files with transparent backgrounds that have the text **cc-image** in their file name. This feature has been tested with SVG and PNG files\n\nTo learn how to make your own stickers, watch the video to the right.\n\n**File name**:\n- Include in the file name the text **cc-image**","type":"text","width":444,"x":-1042,"y":-34}
